### Parse text
POST http://localhost:8000/parse
X-API-Key: DEV_KEY_123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Paid ₹5,000 rent" }

### Create entry (from parsed payload)
POST http://localhost:8000/entries
X-API-Key: DEV_KEY_123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "debit_account": "Rent Expense",
  "credit_account": "Cash",
  "amount": 5000,
  "narration": "Paid rent"
}

### Get entries
GET http://localhost:8000/entries
X-API-Key: DEV_KEY_123

### P&L
GET http://localhost:8000/reports/pnl
X-API-Key: DEV_KEY_123

### Balance sheet
GET http://localhost:8000/reports/balance-sheet
X-API-Key: DEV_KEY_123

### Export Excel
GET http://localhost:8000/export/excel
X-API-Key: DEV_KEY_123

### Export PDF
GET http://localhost:8000/export/pdf
X-API-Key: DEV_KEY_123
